{"summary":"Puzzle card game with simple rules and strategic play","description":"\"Cube Card\" is a simple rule puzzle card game that moves character cards with strategic play. (Playable in Offline, Airplane mode)\n\n Attack monsters and blocks with weapons, character's Hp, and bombs, and collect points by collecting gold while recovering character's health with potions. You can acquire new dungeons and characters by increasing the number of points while earning skill cards with the power of the cube. You can also unlock characters' abilities and new skill cards with gold from dungeons.\n\n You can challenge dungeons with 21 characters of unique abilities. They are Archer, Sorceress, Adventurer, Priest, Dr.crow, Paladin, Bard, Knight, Thief, Witch, Pirate, Maid, Solar Knight, Miner, Succubus, Miko, Samurai, Ninja, Princess, Royal knight and Dancer.\n\n Gameplay with a mix of Roguelike elements provides new dungeons and new experiences each time.\n\n◆ Game Features\n\n- Playable in Offline, Airplane mode\n- Fast game progress! Counter-Attack, Dodge and Critical Attack!\n- Simple one-handed control and strategic play\n- 21 characters of unique abilities\n- Various 20 Dungeons (Normal, Mimic, Gold, Chaos Dungeon)\n- 80+ Monsters and various cards \n- Enhance your character by 20 ability level up\n- Various weapons, attributes and trophies\n- Various powerful 42 skill cards\n- 2D cartoon style graphic\n- Language supported : English, Korean, Japanese","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HyTGANNc6PE?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Npi0bheg9AhX2ispm5E68E-yOBNSU0o9nxat59MR4ODq336mR15umuyQzvcNI49RxIcT2OOJ_lHuAYz7fjG412k","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/V5-YAruB4pY88jPQ4YQCvD895M2MhHwfvpnmXyRJaZoEg7CUZIlqeOkSgeHa-wTwy5jWBzemMz2Icj6BO4aqzSU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AIbYYb-7eQ4X4u8ozqi2JMENuJhtVhLmQlWgZI3U6zDdp_d_K